{"seq":2,"slug":"app-store-aso-launch","title":"App Store 上架与 ASO","stage":"DONE","category":"indie-app-shipping","categoryLabel":"独立开发与上架","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/app-store-aso-launch","rating":{"composite":3.63,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# App Store 上架与 ASO 简介\n\n做好了产品，还要让目标用户在应用商店找到它、点进来、并下载——这是 ASO（应用商店优化）与上架的功夫。本 hub 面向要把 app 推上 App Store / Google Play 的独立开发者，从商店列表优化（标题副标题图标、截图预览、描述转化）讲起，覆盖关键词与排名（关键词调研、ASO 排名因素、iOS 与 Android 的差异）、评分与评价（为何重要、如何请求、应对差评），以及审核与发布（审核流程、常见拒审、发布日运作）。贯穿全篇的实操主线是：把第一眼三件套和截图做到位（转化权重最高）、主攻中长尾关键词、用真实好产品和主动引导经营评分、为审核留缓冲——而发布日只是长跑的起点，持续的优化与迭代才是独立 app 增长的重头。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"store-listing","title":"Store Listing","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/app-store-aso-launch/store-listing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"title-subtitle-icon","title":"标题、副标题与图标","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/app-store-aso-launch/store-listing/title-subtitle-icon","wordCount":1809,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"screenshots-and-preview","title":"截图与预览视频","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/app-store-aso-launch/store-listing/screenshots-and-preview","wordCount":1771,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"description-and-conversion","title":"描述与转化","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/app-store-aso-launch/store-listing/description-and-conversion","wordCount":1701,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲商店列表优化：标题/副标题/图标这「第一眼三件套」如何兼顾 ASO 关键词与点击转化、截图与预览视频作为转化权重最高的视觉销售材料如何设计、以及描述的双重作用（认真用户的临门一脚 + Google Play 的关键词索引）与在转化漏斗中的合理精力分配。\n"},{"seq":2,"slug":"keywords-and-ranking","title":"Keywords And Ranking","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/app-store-aso-launch/keywords-and-ranking","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"keyword-research","title":"关键词调研","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/app-store-aso-launch/keywords-and-ranking/keyword-research","wordCount":1669,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"aso-ranking-factors","title":"ASO 排名因素","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/app-store-aso-launch/keywords-and-ranking/aso-ranking-factors","wordCount":1748,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"ios-vs-android-aso","title":"iOS 与 Android 的 ASO 差异","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/app-store-aso-launch/keywords-and-ranking/ios-vs-android-aso","wordCount":1618,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲关键词与排名：从用户真实搜索语言出发、按搜索量/竞争/相关三维度选词、主攻能真正排上去的中长尾的关键词调研，文本相关性与表现因素两类 ASO 排名因素及「相关性高于一切」，以及 iOS（关键词字段、不索引描述）与 Android（索引描述）的根本差异。\n"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ratings-and-reviews","title":"Ratings And Reviews","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/app-store-aso-launch/ratings-and-reviews","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-ratings-matter","title":"评分为何重要","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/app-store-aso-launch/ratings-and-reviews/why-ratings-matter","wordCount":1902,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"asking-for-reviews","title":"请求评价","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/app-store-aso-launch/ratings-and-reviews/asking-for-reviews","wordCount":1923,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"handling-negative-reviews","title":"应对负面评价","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/app-store-aso-launch/ratings-and-reviews/handling-negative-reviews","wordCount":1772,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲评分与评价：评分对排名与转化的双重乘数影响及 4 星心理门槛、如何在用户高光时刻用官方应用内 API 合规地请求满意用户评价并给不满者商店外的出口，以及把负面评价当改进信号、用专业的公开回复和产品改进来应对。一切技巧建立在产品真好用之上。\n"},{"seq":4,"slug":"review-and-launch","title":"Review And Launch","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/app-store-aso-launch/review-and-launch","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"app-review-process","title":"应用审核流程","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/app-store-aso-launch/review-and-launch/app-review-process","wordCount":1726,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"common-rejections","title":"常见拒审原因","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/app-store-aso-launch/review-and-launch/common-rejections","wordCount":1752,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"launch-day-mechanics","title":"发布日的运作","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/app-store-aso-launch/review-and-launch/launch-day-mechanics","wordCount":1895,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲审核与发布：iOS 严格人工 vs Android 宽松自动化的审核流程及如何顺利通过、支付/隐私/完整性/元数据等少数几类常见拒审原因及自查规避，以及发布日的运作——它是长跑的起点而非终点，靠集中冲量启动 ASO 飞轮，但持续优化迭代才是增长重头。\n"}]}